E &amp; PACKAGE</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_2","label":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_2","default":"<p>SHIPPING INFORMATION</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_3","label":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_3","default":"<p>HOW DO THEY WORK?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_4","label":"ggwJRcSRB8J_childItem_4","default":"<p>CAN I WEAR THEM ALL DAY?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeky56BLVe_text","label":"ggeky56BLVe_text","default":"<p>Blue light, particularly from digital screens, is known to interfere with the body's natural sleep-wake cycle, or circadian rhythm. At night, exposure to blue light can suppress the production of melatonin, the hormone that signals your body to prepare for sleep. This suppression can lead to difficulty falling asleep, disrupted sleep patterns, and overall poorer sleep quality. Additionally, blue light contributes to digital eye strain, which can cause discomfort and may lead to more serious eye issues over time.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQa8E07dJW_text","label":"ggQa8E07dJW_text","default":"<p>- FREE Shipping on orders +49€<br>&nbsp;</p><p>- Spain and Portugal orders 1-3 working days</p><p>- Rest of Europe orders 3-5 working days approximately.</p><p>- Latin America orders 10-15 working days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shipment tracking ID will be provided after your product(s) is dispatched.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGkzOF8L4W_text","label":"ggGkzOF8L4W_text","default":"<p>Blue light blocking glasses are equipped with lenses that contain special coatings or pigments that absorb and block a significant portion of blue light emitted from digital screens before it reaches your eyes. This technology helps to reduce eye strain and minimizes the potential disruption to your natural sleep cycle caused by blue light exposure.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcx6K9I5mh_text","label":"ggcx6K9I5mh_text","default":"<p>Yes, blue light blocking glasses are designed to be worn throughout the day, especially if you are frequently exposed to digital screens. They are beneficial not only in preventing eye strain during long hours of screen time but also in reducing exposure to blue light throughout the day, which can help maintain an improved sleep cycle.</p>"}],
